platoon color circle diameter 25
DebugDrawPlanLandSingleAttack       red
DebugDrawPlanLandAttackPrimary      dark red
DebugDrawPlanLandAttack             yellow
DebugDrawplanSupportLandPrimaryPlatoon  dark yellow


